# Title: Suspicious Execution Location Of Wermgr.EXE
# ID: 5394fcc7-aeb2-43b5-9a09-cac9fc5edcd5
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-14
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects suspicious Windows Error Reporting manager (wermgr.exe) execution location.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*\\wermgr.exe) AND NOT (((process.executable:C:\\Windows\\System32\\* OR process.executable:C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\* OR process.executable:C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*))))
